# Complex numbers as records (f64, f64), added component-wise in 2D
# notation; cf. Zuse's type A13 and the example "Z + V => R".
# run: 1.5,2 0.25,-4 => 1.75,-2 / -2
P1 cadd | (V,         V)         ⇒ (R,         R)
      V |  0          1             0          1
      S |  (f64,f64)  (f64,f64)     (f64,f64)  f64

        | V + V ⇒ R
      V | 0   1   0
      K | 0   0   0

        | V + V ⇒ R
      V | 0   1   0
      K | 1   1   1

        | R ⇒ R
      V | 0   1
      K | 1
END
